# Environment Variables Configuration

# Google Analytics Measurement ID
# Get this from: https://analytics.google.com
# Format: G-9S5X87MCEZ
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-9S5X87MCEZ

# Google Search Console Verification Code
# Get this from: https://search.google.com/search-console
# This is the content value from the verification meta tag
VITE_GSC_VERIFICATION=YOUR_VERIFICATION_CODE_HERE
